      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T16:26:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "layoutlib is maybe a bit different but framework team not supporting Robolectric (and thus not allowing it in presubmit on framework) is a decade-long policy at this point, and PSAs have been sent out in the past ( https://groups.google.com/a/google.com/g/android-eng/c/kuc4-_JITjY/m/q_fdDQCsAQAJ )",
      "parentUuid": "e604d2f1_615d1b1b",
